{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Electronic Market Simulator&quot; is a cool-headed first-person simulation with every detail of running an Electronic Market.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORE MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/03d042ec23909d344decddb1af694933.poster.avif?t=1765906754\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/03d042ec23909d344decddb1af694933.webm?t=1765906754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/03d042ec23909d344decddb1af694933.mp4?t=1765906754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your store to be beautiful and efficient. Determine where products will be displayed, manage your shelves and provide a perfect shopping experience by increasing customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUPPLY GOODS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/d3c5da181c3463500faf3fd3c261b916.poster.avif?t=1765906754\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/d3c5da181c3463500faf3fd3c261b916.webm?t=1765906754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/d3c5da181c3463500faf3fd3c261b916.mp4?t=1765906754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order items using the in-game computer. Place the products in your store as you wish and offer them to your customers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CASHIER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/01ce116350873969daa8f8b6c7e2e005.poster.avif?t=1765906754\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/01ce116350873969daa8f8b6c7e2e005.webm?t=1765906754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/01ce116350873969daa8f8b6c7e2e005.mp4?t=1765906754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move items through registers and collect payments by cash or credit card. Hire extra cashiers to increase customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE YOUR STORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/ab56c6dd34444428d7eb696218117699.poster.avif?t=1765906754\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/ab56c6dd34444428d7eb696218117699.webm?t=1765906754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/ab56c6dd34444428d7eb696218117699.mp4?t=1765906754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your building when you're ready; add more cashiers to increase your sales speed and take your store to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONLINE ORDERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/76a966741aa082e52a670850263daef5.poster.avif?t=1765906754\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/76a966741aa082e52a670850263daef5.webm?t=1765906754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/76a966741aa082e52a670850263daef5.mp4?t=1765906754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track online orders to deliver your products to customers. The faster you act, the faster you can earn money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SET PRICE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/5cf904dae9e75243db90069b659732b8.poster.avif?t=1765906754\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/5cf904dae9e75243db90069b659732b8.webm?t=1765906754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/5cf904dae9e75243db90069b659732b8.mp4?t=1765906754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money, level up and expand your store. Then increase your earnings by renting new stores. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customer satisfaction and price policy are very important to be successful in the &quot;Electronic Market Simulator&quot; game. Will you be able to win this race to get to the top of the city by making the right decisions and increasing the number of stores?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3041550?t=1765906754","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765906754","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765906754","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765906754","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Electronic Market Simulator&quot; is a cool-headed first-person simulation with every detail of running an Electronic Market.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORE MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/03d042ec23909d344decddb1af694933.poster.avif?t=1765906754\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/03d042ec23909d344decddb1af694933.webm?t=1765906754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3041550/extras/03d042ec23909d344decddb1af694